// v40 per-family risk localization additions.
Object.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.ru, {"Per-Family Live Risk":"Риск по категориям","Keep Movement, Reach, Mining, Packet Abuse and Client Integrity risk isolated":"Разделять риск движения, дальности, добычи, пакетных нарушений и целостности клиента","Each family decays independently. Global live risk is the strongest current family instead of a sum across unrelated detectors, so one family cannot prime another for a kick.":"Риск каждой категории снижается независимо. Общий текущий риск равен максимальному риску одной категории, а не сумме несвязанных детекторов, поэтому одна категория не может подготовить другую к кику.","Family":"Категория","Decay (sec)":"Снижение (с)","Review ≥":"Проверка ≥","Suspicious ≥":"Подозрение ≥","Packet Abuse":"Пакетные нарушения","Client Integrity":"Целостность клиента","Family risk ≥":"Риск категории ≥","Legacy maximum risk bonus":"Устаревший макс. бонус риска","With per-family risk enabled, correlation is supporting evidence only and does not add risk across unrelated families. The maximum bonus setting is retained only for legacy global-risk mode. Occurrences expire on their own timestamps inside the configured window.":"При раздельном риске корреляция служит только подтверждающим контекстом и не складывает риск несвязанных категорий. Максимальный бонус сохранён только для старого режима общего риска. События истекают по собственным меткам времени в заданном окне."});
Object.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.fr, {"Per-Family Live Risk":"Risque actif par catégorie","Keep Movement, Reach, Mining, Packet Abuse and Client Integrity risk isolated":"Isoler les risques de mouvement, portée, minage, abus de paquets et intégrité client","Each family decays independently. Global live risk is the strongest current family instead of a sum across unrelated detectors, so one family cannot prime another for a kick.":"Chaque catégorie diminue indépendamment. Le risque global actif correspond à la catégorie la plus élevée au lieu d’additionner des détecteurs sans rapport, afin qu’une catégorie ne puisse pas préparer une autre à une expulsion.","Family":"Catégorie","Decay (sec)":"Décroissance (s)","Review ≥":"Révision ≥","Suspicious ≥":"Suspect ≥","Packet Abuse":"Abus de paquets","Client Integrity":"Intégrité client","Family risk ≥":"Risque catégorie ≥","Legacy maximum risk bonus":"Bonus de risque max. hérité","With per-family risk enabled, correlation is supporting evidence only and does not add risk across unrelated families. The maximum bonus setting is retained only for legacy global-risk mode. Occurrences expire on their own timestamps inside the configured window.":"Avec le risque par catégorie, la corrélation sert uniquement de preuve complémentaire et n’ajoute pas de risque entre catégories sans rapport. Le bonus maximal est conservé uniquement pour l’ancien mode de risque global. Les occurrences expirent selon leur propre horodatage dans la fenêtre configurée."});
Object.assign(WEB_COMMON_LITERALS.de, {"Per-Family Live Risk":"Live-Risiko je Kategorie","Keep Movement, Reach, Mining, Packet Abuse and Client Integrity risk isolated":"Risiken für Bewegung, Reichweite, Mining, Paketmissbrauch und Client-Integrität getrennt halten","Each family decays independently. Global live risk is the strongest current family instead of a sum across unrelated detectors, so one family cannot prime another for a kick.":"Jede Kategorie baut Risiko unabhängig ab. Das globale Live-Risiko entspricht der aktuell höchsten Kategorie statt einer Summe unabhängiger Detektoren, damit eine Kategorie keine andere für einen Kick vorbelastet.","Family":"Kategorie","Decay (sec)":"Abbau (Sek.)","Review ≥":"Prüfung ≥","Suspicious ≥":"Verdächtig ≥","Packet Abuse":"Paketmissbrauch","Client Integrity":"Client-Integrität","Family risk ≥":"Kategorienrisiko ≥","Legacy maximum risk bonus":"Alter maximaler Risikobonus","With per-family risk enabled, correlation is supporting evidence only and does not add risk across unrelated families. The maximum bonus setting is retained only for legacy global-risk mode. Occurrences expire on their own timestamps inside the configured window.":"Bei aktiviertem Kategorienrisiko ist Korrelation nur unterstützende Evidenz und addiert kein Risiko zwischen unabhängigen Kategorien. Der maximale Bonus bleibt nur für den alten globalen Risikomodus erhalten. Vorkommnisse laufen anhand ihrer eigenen Zeitstempel im konfigurierten Fenster ab."});


